#.   T & F & F & T & F & F \\
#.   F & T & T & F & T & T \\
#.   F & F & T & T & T & T \\
#.   \\hline
#. \\end{array}
#. $$
#: Game.Levels.EquivWorld.equiv_docs
msgid "An implication is logically equivalent to its contrapositive. We can prove this via a truth-table:\n"
