"The conditional law says that §2 is logically equivalent to §3. This looks **very** close to that statement. We might start by ***rewriting*** the right-hand side of our goal using §4.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"  ### **❯ The §5 tactic**\n"
"  In order to apply ***rewrites*** (or substitutions) in Lean, we use the §6 tactic. 🔍 Check out the entry for §7 in the **Tactics** tab for details. 👉 In this specific case, try\n"
