#. ```
#. §3: `Or_comm`
#. §4: $$
#. \\begin{array}{|cc||cc|}
#.   \\hline
#.   P & Q & P ∨ Q & Q ∨ P  \\
#.   \\hline
#.   T & T & T & T \\
#.   T & F & T & T \\
#.   F & T & T & T \\
#.   F & F & F & F \\
#.   \\hline
#. \\end{array}
#. $$
#: Game.Levels.EquivWorld.equiv_docs
msgid "This is the **Commutative Law** for §0. It says that\n"
"\n"
"§1\n"
"\n"
"Here's what it looks like in Lean:\n"
"§2\n"
